    LLM: 'Game: 21 Point Black Tile. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '21 Point Black Tile is a Hearts-style domino game using a double-six set: 21 penalty points per deal. Three or four players pass three tiles left; leader nominates suit each trick. Lowest total score wins.',
